  fruiting:{label:'Fruiting vegetable (tomato, bean, squash…)',sun:'full',water:'medium',tips:['Needs warmth and at least 6–8 hours of sun.','Start indoors in cool climates and plant out after the last frost.','Feed with a high-potash feed once flowers appear.','Water evenly and deeply; pick often to keep it producing.']},
  root:{label:'Root or bulb (carrot, onion, yam…)',sun:'full',water:'medium',tips:['Sow straight where it will grow; most root crops dislike transplanting.','Loose, stone-free soil without fresh manure.','Thin seedlings early to give each root room.','Water evenly to avoid split or woody roots.']},
  herb:{label:'Herb',sun:'full',water:'low',tips:['Soft herbs (basil, coriander, parsley) like moisture; woody herbs (rosemary, thyme) like dry, gritty soil.','Pinch the tips regularly for bushy plants.','Most grow well in pots on a sunny windowsill or balcony.','Many root from cuttings in a glass of water.']},
  flower:{label:'Flower',sun:'full',water:'medium',tips:['Check if it is an annual (one season), biennial or perennial.','Deadhead faded flowers to get more.','Most flowering plants need at least 6 hours of sun.','Native flowers feed local pollinators best.']},
  house:{label:'Houseplant',sun:'part',water:'low',tips:['Most houseplants die from too much water: water when the top few centimetres are dry, and use pots with drainage holes.','Bright, indirect light suits most; cacti and succulents want direct sun.','Feed lightly in spring and summer only.','Wipe dust off leaves; repot every 1–2 years in spring.']},
  succulent:{label:'Cactus or succulent',sun:'full',water:'low',tips:['Free-draining cactus compost and a terracotta pot.','Soak, then let the soil dry out completely.','The brightest window you have; harden off before full outdoor sun.','Many grow from a single leaf or offset.']},
  tree:{label:'Tree, shrub or fruit tree',sun:'full',water:'medium',tips:['Plant in autumn or winter when it is dormant, unless the ground is frozen.','Dig a wide, shallow hole; keep the root collar at soil level.','Water weekly for the first two summers and keep grass away from the base.','Prune in winter (or after flowering for spring flowerers).']},
  tropical:{label:'Tropical plant (banana, mango, coffee…)',sun:'full',water:'high',tips:['Needs warmth all year (no frost); indoors in cool climates.','Rich soil, lots of mulch and regular water.','High humidity — mist or group plants together.','Plant at the start of the rainy season in the tropics.']}
